            <description><![CDATA[<h2>QuotaKit 0.32.4.25 Mobile 1.11.3</h2>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Codex: prioritize and independently publish the configured recent cost window while older history continues catching up.</li>
<li>Spend Dashboard: respect the configured 30-day window instead of expanding shared repairs to 365 days.</li>
<li>Codex: retry transient bounded no-progress passes without replacing newer foreground totals.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/ColumbusLabs/QuotaKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
